      "parameters": {
        "content": "SETUP NOTES\n\n1. Apify: HTTP Request nodes call https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/<actorId>/run-sync-get-dataset-items with a Bearer token (Apify API Token credential). The JSON body for each actor is a BEST-EFFORT default — open each actor page on Apify and adjust the input fields (search terms, location, limits) to match that actor's real input schema.\n\n2. The native Apify node is not installed on this instance, so Run Actor + Get Dataset Items is done via HTTP Request (one synchronous call does both).\n\n3. Google Sheet must have columns: job_id, title, company, link, date_sent, score, reason, status.\n\n4. AI model: pick a Claude model in the AI Match Decision node.\n\n5. Filter Chat ID node: replace YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID with your own Telegram user ID (get it by messaging @userinfobot) — this is what stops random people from running the bot on your API credits."
      },
